                  "multiple": false,
                  "typeClass": "primitive",
                  "value": "This study is part of a larger ongoing longitudinal study called BIBO, which is run by prof. Carolina de Weerth at Radboud UMC. This paper describes associations between epigenetic ageing and behavioural data in this study. As the data is owned by the Radboud University, I will not publish any of the data here, but will include the used syntax for the paper."
